                // 浠ュ墠瀹屽叏鐪嬩笉瑙侊紝绛変簬銆屾垜璁扮硦浜嗘病鏈夈€嶈繖浠朵簨娌℃湁瑙傛祴銆?                counts: { ...(r.debug && r.debug.counts), faded: packed.lines.filter((l) => l.fade > 0).length },
                kept: r.debug && r.debug.kept, dropped: packed.dropped.map((x) => x.section),
